MCPclient -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 1: Discover groups for a job and context budget\n<size:14>[MCP2025-11-25 Streamable HTTP over authenticated loopback TCP/owner adb forward]</size>
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.ClientAuthenticator <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 2: Authenticate request
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.FunctionalGroupIndex <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 3: Search summaries only
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.FunctionalGroupIndex -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.CatalogRepository <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 4: Read full searchable index and dependency closure
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.FunctionalGroupIndex -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.AdmissionGate <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 5: Query per-client permission status; discovery grants nothing
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer -> MCPclient <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 6: Return ranked bounded summaries and discovery cursor\n<size:14>[MCP2025-11-25]</size>
MCPclient -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 7: Request activation with selected IDs, pins and current group-view ETag\n<size:14>[MCP2025-11-25 Streamable HTTP over authenticated loopback TCP/owner adb forward]</size>
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.FunctionalGroupIndex <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 8: Begin requested atomic activation with expected pins
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.FunctionalGroupIndex -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.DeviceViewResolver <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 9: Validate availability and required type/dependency closure
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.FunctionalGroupIndex -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.CatalogRepository <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 10: CAS commit coherent activation or return stale/conflict
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.FunctionalGroupIndex -> AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 11: Return committed group view or explicit conflict
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer -> MCPclient <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 12: Return committed group epoch/hash; portable generic-invoke fallback remains\n<size:14>[MCP2025-11-25]</size>
AndroidMCPbridge.AndroidbridgeAPK.McpServer -> MCPclient <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : 13: For opted-in dynamic aliases, best-effort tools/list_changed; host context eviction not guaranteed\n<size:14>[MCP2025-11-25]</size>

